# tally 2.2 (CHANGES.md 2.2-5), L §5.19 One movement on two statements: "A line between two observed rows has no day
# of its own: in the worlds its file is in (§6.4) it holds at every cut that sees both rows, whichever version states
# it." o1's rows are known 2026-03-10 and their line 2026-04-15: as known 2026-03-25 they are one movement (n1: 1, b3:
# 1 000.00 - 100.00 - 50.00 = 850.00 PLN; 2.1.8 counted 2 and printed 750.00 PLN). o2's line is known 2026-03-12 and
# card[o2] 2026-03-20: as known 2026-03-15 the line is not in force and bank[o2] is read alone (b2: 850.00 PLN; 2.1.8
# refused it, RUN-RECORD `same bank[o2] = card[o2]: card[o2] doesn't exist`); as known 2026-03-25 they are one (n3).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-30
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place sav: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
input bank: observed
input card: observed

ask n1: count(x in transfers over 2026-03-01 .. 2026-03-01) as known 2026-03-25
ask n2: count(x in transfers over 2026-03-02 .. 2026-03-02) as known 2026-03-15
ask b2: bal(konto, 2026-03-31) as known 2026-03-15
ask b3: bal(konto, 2026-03-31) as known 2026-03-25
ask n3: count(x in transfers over 2026-03-02 .. 2026-03-02) as known 2026-03-25

version v0
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  opening[konto] = 1 000.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "o"
  opening[sav] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "o"

version b
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-03-10
  bank[o1] = (on: 2026-03-01, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to sav amount 100.00 PLN) "b1"
  card[o1] = (on: 2026-03-01, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to sav amount 100.00 PLN) "c1"
  bank[o2] = (on: 2026-03-02, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to sav amount 50.00 PLN) "b2"

version c
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-03-20
  card[o2] = (on: 2026-03-02, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to sav amount 50.00 PLN) "c2"

version early
  cite s
  known 2026-03-12
  same bank[o2] = card[o2]

version late
  cite s
  known 2026-04-15
  same bank[o1] = card[o1]
=== expect
b2: 850.00 PLN
  cut 2026-03-15
b3: 850.00 PLN
  cut 2026-03-25
n1: 1
  cut 2026-03-25
n2: 1
  cut 2026-03-15
n3: 1
  cut 2026-03-25
